es**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1530,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[478,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[522,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1412,"**Tab**"],[196,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[956,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1081,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[911,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1408,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1407,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1545,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[1534,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[537,"**Trade-offs:**"],[479,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[301,"**Trigger and calendar**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a calendar icon and the formatted value from the field. `DatePickerCalendar` (and `DateRangePickerCalendar`) is the calendar in the popover it opens: it takes `Calendar` props plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `Calendar` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[1109,"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[682,"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"],[1717,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based on the `as` value - `useRef<HTMLButtonElement>` works with `as=\"but